<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.09 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.09 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an auction of seven-day Treasury bills was 4.09 percent, the National Debt Office said on Tueday.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids for a total 13 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The paper matures on April 23, the office said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
